#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:599
msgid ""
"The raw data can be preprocessed in R: Nanoseconds in Epoch time can be "
"converted to date-time with the command `as.POSIXct(<NANOSECONDS>/1000000, "
"origin = '1970-01-01', tz = 'Europe/Berlin')`. For example, the nanoseconds "
"in row 1 from the raw output is “2022-08-27 16:52:03 CEST” after conversion."
msgstr ""
"Surove podatke je mogoče predhodno obdelati v R: nanosekunde v epohalnem "
"času je mogoče pretvoriti v datum in čas z ukazom `as."
"POSIXct(<NANOSECONDS>/1000000, origin = '1970-01-01', tz = 'Europe/"
"Berlin')`. Na primer, nanosekunde v vrstici 1 iz surovega izhoda so po "
"pretvorbi »2022-08-27 16:52:03 CEST«."

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:601
msgid ""
"For use with OSCAR, this date-time should then be converted to a character "
"string with the date as DD.MM.YY followed by a comma. All of this can be "
"achieved with one command (this operation can be vectorized over the entire "
"column in the data frame); replace the YYYY-MM-DD date with the date of your "
"measurements:"
msgstr ""
"Za uporabo z OSCAR je treba ta datum in čas nato pretvoriti v niz znakov z "
"datumom v obliki DD.MM.LL, ki mu sledi vejica. Vse to je mogoče doseči z "
"enim ukazom (to operacijo je mogoče vektorizirati čez celoten stolpec v "
"podatkovnem okviru); Datum YYYY-MM-DD zamenjajte z datumom meritev:"

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:603
msgid ""
"`stringr::str_replace(as.character(as.POSIXct(1661611923019071/1000000, "
"origin = '1970-01-01', tz = 'Europe/Berlin')), '2022-08-27', '27.08.22,')`"
msgstr ""
"`stringr::str_replace(as.character(as.POSIXct(1661611923019071/1000000, "
"origin = '1970-01-01', tz = 'Evropa/Berlin')), '2022-08-27', '27.08.22,')`"

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:605
msgid ""
"The output in Watts should be averaged per second. The same data above is "
"shown below after processing with R; note the 7 values above are averaged "
"per second, resulting in two rows."
msgstr ""
"Izhodno moč v vatih je treba povprečiti na sekundo. Isti podatki zgoraj so "
"prikazani spodaj po obdelavi z R; upoštevajte, da je zgornjih 7 vrednosti "
"povprečenih na sekundo, kar pomeni dve vrstici."

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:607
msgid ""
"To save the CSV file with a semi-colon separator, the first column with row "
"names starting at the number 1, and no string delimiter, use the following R "
"command:"
msgstr ""
"Če želite shraniti datoteko CSV z ločilom podpičja, prvim stolpcem z imeni "
"vrstic, ki se začnejo s številko 1, in brez ločila nizov, uporabite "
"naslednji ukaz R:"

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:609
msgid ""
"`write.csv2(<DATAFRAME>, file = <PATH/TO/FILE.csv>, row.names = TRUE, quote "
"= FALSE)`"
msgstr ""
"`write.csv2(<DATAFRAME>, file = <PATH/TO/FILE.csv>, row.names = TRUE, quote "
"= FALSE)`"

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:611
msgid "The result should look something like the following:"
msgstr "Rezultat bi se moral videti nekako takole:"

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:615
msgid "27.08.22, 16:52:03 ;"
msgstr "27.08.22, 16:52:03 ;"

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:615
