#: content/blog/2022-03-05-energy-conservation-day.md:0
msgid ""
"March 5th is Energy Conservation Day. Celebrate with Free Software and KDE "
"Eco!"
msgstr ""
"5. marec je dan varčevanja z energijo. Proslavite ga z prostim programjem in "
"Eko KDE!"

#: content/blog/2022-03-05-energy-conservation-day.md:13
msgid ""
"Of the challenges humanity faces in its struggle to power modern-day "
"civilization, energy conservation is one of the more difficult to achieve. "
"But it is also the most worthy of pursuing, as ultimately many of the "
"current sources of energy we depend on are finite."
msgstr ""
"Od izzivov, s katerimi se človeštvo sooča v svojem boju za napajanje sodobne "
"civilizacije, je varčevanje z energijo eden od težje dosegljivih. Je pa tudi "
"najbolj vreden zasledovanja, saj so na koncu številni sedanji viri energije, "
"od katerih smo odvisni, končni."

#: content/blog/2022-03-05-energy-conservation-day.md:15
msgid ""
"That is why reducing the amount of energy we consume is a priority for [KDE "
"Eco](https://eco.kde.org/). All [KDE](https://kde.org) projects are Free "
"Software, and Free Software entails transparency and user autonomy. The "
"first has always provided users the opportunity to inspect and learn from "
"how software runs; today, this transparency has been extended to include "
"software's [energy consumption](https://invent.kde.org/teams/eco/feep) when "
"in use. The second allows Free Software users to install what they need on "
"the devices they want, bypassing unnecessary and battery-draining spyware "
"and bloatware while [extending the lifespan of their hardware](https://fsfe."
"org/activities/upcyclingandroid/). Both combined give KDE Eco and Free "
"Software developers the means to develop energy-saving improvements for "
"applications and frameworks, to continue support for otherwise unsupported "
"devices, and deploy exactly what people want and need."
msgstr ""
"Zato je zmanjšanje količin porabljene energije prednostna naloga za [Eko KDE]"
"(https://eco.kde.org/). Vsi projekti [KDE](https://kde.org) so prosta "
"programska oprema, prosta programska oprema pa omogoča preglednost in "
"uporabniško avtonomijo. Prva je uporabnikom vedno nudila možnost, da "
"pregledajo in se naučijo, kako deluje programska oprema; danes je bila ta "
"preglednost razširjena tako, da vključuje [porabo energije programja]"
"(https://invent.kde.org/teams/eco/feep) med uporabo. Druga omogoča "
"uporabnikom proste programske opreme, da namestijo tisto, kar potrebujejo na "
"naprave, ki jih želijo, zaobidejo nepotrebno in baterijo-izčrpujočo vohunsko "
"in napuhnjeno programsko opremo, medtem ko [podaljšajo življenjsko dobo "
"svoje strojne opreme](https://fsfe.org/activities/upcyclingandroid/). Oba "
"skupaj dajeta Eko KDE in razvijalcem proste programske opreme sredstva za "
"razvoj izboljšav za varčevanje z energijo za aplikacije in ogrodja, za "
"nadaljevanje podpore za sicer nepodprte naprave in uvajanje točno tega, kar "
"ljudje želijo in potrebujejo."

#: content/blog/2022-03-05-energy-conservation-day.md:19
msgid "![](/blog/images/tag-des-energiesparens.jpg)"
msgstr "![](/blog/images/tag-des-energiesparens.jpg)"

#: content/blog/2022-03-05-energy-conservation-day.md:21
msgid ""
"*Germany has declared 5 March [Energy Conservation Day](https://www.bmuv.de/"
"service/veranstaltungen/veranstaltung/tag-des-energiesparens). Today we are "
"inviting you to [join us](https://eco.kde.org/get-involved/) at KDE Eco! "
"([Image: CC0](https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/))*"
msgstr ""
"*Nemčija je razglasila 5. marec za [Dan varčevanja z energijo](https://www."
"bmuv.de/service/veranstaltungen/veranstaltung/tag-des-energiesparens). Danes "
"vas vabimo, da se nam [pridružite](https://eco.kde.org/get-involved/) v Eko "
"KDE! ([Slika: CC0](https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/))**"

#: content/blog/2022-03-05-energy-conservation-day.md:25
msgid ""
"Clearly, energy conservation for a small number of software products is not "
"going to make any noticeable difference. But imagine if we start a trend; "
"imagine conserving even small amounts of energy on every app, game, and "
"framework; on hundreds of thousands of programs, running across millions of "
"devices with continuous support. Users will enjoy longer battery lives and "
"lower electricity bills. They can keep using still-functioning hardware, "
"with greater personal savings yet reduced global C02 emissions by avoiding "
"the unnecessary production and shipment of new devices. Most importantly, as "
"a species we will use fewer shared resources while keeping humanity's "
"digital civilization running."
msgstr ""
"Jasno je, da ohranjanje energije za majhno število programskih izdelkov ne "
"bo prineslo opaznih sprememb. Ampak predstavljajte si, da začnemo trend; "
"predstavljajte si prihranek tudi majhnih količin energije v vsaki "
"aplikaciji, igri in ogrodju; več sto tisoč programov, ki se izvajajo na več "
"milijonih naprav s stalno podporo. Uporabniki bodo uživali v daljšem času "
"uporabnosti baterij in nižjih računih za elektriko. Še naprej bodo lahko "
"uporabljali še vedno delujočo strojno opremo, z večjimi osebnimi prihranki, "
"vendar zmanjšanimi globalnimi emisijami C02, tako da se izognejo nepotrebni "
"proizvodnji in pošiljanju novih naprav. Najpomembneje je, da bomo kot vrsta "
"uporabili manj skupnih virov, hkrati pa bomo ohranjali digitalno "
"civilizacijo človeštva pri življenju."

#: content/blog/2022-03-05-energy-conservation-day.md:27
msgid "You can be part of that."
msgstr "Lahko ste del tega."

#: content/blog/2022-03-05-energy-conservation-day.md:29
msgid ""
"Germany has declared 5 March [Energy Conservation Day](https://www.bmuv.de/"
"service/veranstaltungen/veranstaltung/tag-des-energiesparens), and today we "
"are inviting you to join us. Whether you are a user concerned with the "
"carbon footprint of your computing usage, or a project looking to improve "
"the efficiency of your software, [visit our website](https://eco.kde.org/) "
"to find out how to participate in KDE Eco and [join us in our chat room]"
"(https://matrix.to/#/#energy-efficiency:kde.org) to talk live to other "
"members of the project."
msgstr ""
"Nemčija je razglasila 5. marec za [Dan varčevanja z energijo](https://www."
"bmuv.de/service/veranstaltungen/veranstaltung/tag-des-energiesparens), danes "
"pa vas vabimo, da se nam pridružite. Ne glede na to, ali ste uporabnik, ki "
"se zanima za ogljični odtis svoje računalniške opreme, ali projekt, ki si "
"želi izboljšati učinkovitost svoje programske opreme, [obiščite našo spletno "
"stran](https://eco.kde.org/), da izveste, kako sodelovati v Eko KDE, in [se "
"nam pridružite v naši klepetalnici](https://matrix.to/#/#energy-učinkovitost:"
"kde.org) za pogovor v živo z drugimi člani projekta."

#: content/blog/2022-03-05-energy-conservation-day.md:31
msgid "See you on Energy Conservation Day!"
msgstr "Se vidimo na dan varčevanja z energijo!"

#: content/blog/2022-03-05-energy-conservation-day.md:35
msgid ""
"The BE4FOSS project was funded by the Federal Environment Agency and the "
"Federal Ministry for the Environment, Nature Conservation, Nuclear Safety "
"and Consumer Protection (BMUV<sup><a id=\"fnr.1\" class=\"footref\" href="
"\"#fn.1\">1</a></sup>), who organize the *Tag des Energiesparens* (Energy "
"Conservation Day). The funds are made available by resolution of the German "
"Bundestag."
msgstr ""
"Projekt BE4Foss sta financirala nemška Zvezna agencija za okolje in Zvezno "
"ministrstvo za okolje, ohranjanje narave, jedrsko varnost in varstvo "
"potrošnikov (BMUV<sup><a id=\"fnr.1\" class=\"footref\" href=\"#fn.1\">1</"
"a></sup>), ki organizirata *Tag des Energiesparens* (Dan varčevanja z "
"energijo). Sredstva so na voljo z resolucijo nemškega Bundestaga."

#: content/blog/2022-03-16-press-release-okular-blue-angel.md:0
msgid ""
"First Ever Eco-Certified Computer Program: KDE's Popular PDF Reader Okular"
msgstr ""
"Prvi sploh ekološko potrjen računalniški program: popularni KDE bralnik PDF "
"datotek Okular"

#: content/blog/2022-03-16-press-release-okular-blue-angel.md:0
msgid ""
"The multi-platform Free and Open-Source Software product is now officially "
"recognized for sustainable software design"
msgstr ""
"Več platformski prost in odprtokodni programski proizvod je zdaj uradno "
"prepoznan kot trajnostni programski design"

#: content/blog/2022-03-16-press-release-okular-blue-angel.md:0
#: content/blog/2022-09-28_okular_blue-angel-award-ceremony.md:0
msgid "Okular"
msgstr "Okular"

#: content/blog/2022-03-16-press-release-okular-blue-angel.md:0
msgid "Global Ecolabelling Network"
msgstr "Global Ecolabelling Network"

#: content/blog/2022-03-16-press-release-okular-blue-angel.md:0
msgid "Press release to announce Okular receiving the Blue Angel eco-label."
msgstr ""
"Sporočilo za javnost ob objavi da Okular prejme ekološko oznako Modrega "
"angela."

#: content/blog/2022-03-16-press-release-okular-blue-angel.md:16
msgid "Okular screenshot"
msgstr "Zaslonska slika Okularja"

#: content/blog/2022-03-16-press-release-okular-blue-angel.md:18
msgid "Okular Icon"
msgstr "Ikona Okularja"

#: content/blog/2022-03-16-press-release-okular-blue-angel.md:20
msgid ""
"[Okular](https://okular.kde.org/), KDE's popular multi-platform PDF reader "
"and universal document viewer, has officially been recognized for "
"sustainable software design as reflected in the recent [award criteria for "
"software eco-certification](https://produktinfo.blauer-engel.de/uploads/"
"criteriafile/en/DE-UZ%20215-202001-en-Criteria-2020-02-13.pdf). In February "
"2022 Okular was [awarded the Blue Angel ecolabel](https://www.blauer-engel."
"de/en/productworld/resources-and-energy-efficient-software-products), the "
"official environmental label awarded by the German government. Introduced in "
"1978, Blue Angel is the world's earliest established environmental label, "
"and Okular is the first software product to be certified with its seal. What "
"is more, Okular is the first ️ever eco-certified computer program within the "
"30 organizations of the [Global Ecolabelling Network](https://www."
"globalecolabelling.net/)! This network, of which Blue Angel is a member, "
"represents over 50 countries."
msgstr ""
"[Okular](https://okular.kde.org/), KDE je priljubljena več-platformski "
"bralnik PDF in univerzalni pregledovalnik dokumentov, je uradno priznan za "
"trajnostno oblikovano programsko opremo, kot se odraža v zadnjih [merilih za "
"dodelitev za ekološko priznanje programske opreme](https://produktinfo."
"blauer-engel.de/uploads/criteriafile/en/DE-UZ%20215-202001-en-"
"Criteria-2020-02-13.pdf)). Februarja 2022 je bil Okular [nagrajen z ekološko "
"značko Modrega angela](https://www.blauer-engel.de/en/productworld/resources-"
"and-energy-efficient-software-products), uradni okoljski oznaki, ki jih je "
"podeljuje nemška vlada. Uvedena je bil leta 1978 in Modri angel je prva "
"svetovna okoljska oznaka, in Okular je prva programska oprema, ki je "
"potrjena s tem pečatom. Še več, Okular je prvi ekološko potrjen računalniški "
"program v 30 organizacijah [Global Ecolabelling Network](https://www."
"globalecolabelling.net/)!  To omrežje, kjer je Blue Angel član, predstavlja "
"več kot 50 držav."

#: content/blog/2022-03-16-press-release-okular-blue-angel.md:22
msgid ""
"KDE is a world-wide community of software engineers, artists, writers, "
"translators, and creators who are committed to Free Software development. "
"With KDE's long-standing [mission](https://community.kde.org/KDE/Mission) "
"and guiding [vision](https://community.kde.org/KDE/Vision), as well as the "
"talent and capabilities of its community members, it is no surprise that KDE "
"is a pioneer among the group of people and organizations in driving a "
"discussion on sustainable software. This group includes the [Blue Angel]"
"(https://www.blauer-engel.de/en) itself and [researchers](https://www.umwelt-"
"campus.de/green-software-engineering/refoplan-2018) behind it, supporters "
"such as the [Free Software Foundation Europe](https://fsfe.org/), other Free "
"Software projects, and a growing number of others. Now, with the first ever "
"eco-certified software product, the KDE community is celebrating the "
"achievement together with the wider [Free Software community](https://fsfe."
"org/news/2022/news-20220316-01.en.html), as well as with the computer "
"science department at [Umwelt Campus Birkenfeld](https://www.umwelt-campus."
"de/en/forschung/projekte/green-software-engineering/news-details/first-blue-"
"angel-for-software), where researchers measured the resource and energy-"
"consumption of Okular and other KDE software."
msgstr ""
"KDE je svetovna skupnost programskih inženirjev, umetnikov, pisateljev, "
"prevajalcev in ustvarjalcev, ki so zavezani k prostemu razvoju programske "
"opreme. Z dolgoletno [misijo](https://community.kde.org/KDE/Mission) in "
"vodenjem [vizije](https://community.kde.org/KDE/Vision), kot tudi talenti in "
"sposobnostmi članov skupnosti, to ni presenetljivo, da je KDE pionir med "
"skupino ljudi in organizacij pri trendih in razpravi o trajnostni programski "
"opremi. Ta skupina vključuje samega [Modrega angela](https://www.blauer-"
"engel.de/en) in [raziskovalce](https://www.umwelt-campus.de/green-software-"
"engineering/refoplan-2018), za njimi podpornike, kot je [Free Software "
"Foundation Europe](https://fsfe.org/), druge projekte proste programske "
"opreme in vse večje število drugih. Zdaj, s prvo ekološko potrjeno "
"programsko opremo KDE skupnost praznuje dosežke skupaj s širšo [prosto "
"programsko opremo](https://fsfe.org/news/0222/news-20220316-01.en.html), kot "
"tudi z oddelkom za računalništvo v [okoljskem kampusu Birkenfeld](https://"
"www.umwelt-campus.de/en/forschung/projekte/green-software-engineering/news-"
"details/first-blue-angel-for-software), kjer so raziskovalci izmerili vire "
"in porabo energije Okularja in druge programske opreme KDE."

#: content/blog/2022-03-16-press-release-okular-blue-angel.md:24
msgid ""
"KDE was founded in 1996 and maintains numerous Free and Open-Source Software "
"products, including the Plasma desktop environment; the design app for "
"painters and graphic artists, Krita; the GCompris suite of educational "
"activities for children; Kdenlive, a professional video-editing software "
"product; and, of course, Okular, an essential computer program that lets you "
"view all sorts of documents, including PDFs, comics, scientific and academic "
"papers, and technical drawings. Okular also lets you check digital "
"signatures and sign documents yourself, as well as include annotated text "
"and comments directly embedded into the document."
msgstr ""
"KDE je bil ustanovljen leta 1996 in vzdržuje številne proste in odprtokodne "
"programske opreme, vključno z okoljem na namizju Plasme; aplikacija za "
"oblikovanje za slikarje in grafične umetnike Krita; GCompris za "
"izobraževalne dejavnosti za otroke; Kdenlive, profesionalna programska "
"oprema za urejanje videov; in seveda Okular osnovni računalniški program, ki "
"omogoča pogled vseh vrst dokumentov vključno s PDF, stripi, znanstvenimi in "
"akademskimi dokumenti ter tehničnimi risbami. Okular vam omogoča, da "
"preverite digitalne podpise in sami podpisujete dokumente, kot tudi da vanj "
"vključujete označeno besedilo in komentarje, ki so neposredno vdelani v "
"dokument."

#: content/blog/2022-03-16-press-release-okular-blue-angel.md:26
msgid ""
"The Blue Angel award criteria for software, with its focus on transparency "
"in resource and energy-efficiency, hardware operating life, and user "
"autonomy, provide an excellent benchmark to begin a discussion on software "
"sustainability and push development in this area forward. And so, in 2021 "
"KDE started [KDE Eco](https://eco.kde.org/), a project with the goal of "
"putting KDE and Free Software at the forefront of sustainable software "
"design. Sustainability is not a new goal for Free and Open-Source Software "
"(FOSS). The [four freedoms](http://fsfe.org/freesoftware/freesoftware.en."
"html) have always put Free Software at the forefront of sustainable software "
"design. What *is* new is that FOSS values are now recognized as being "
"directly related to sustainability by organizations such as the German "
"Environment Agency (*Umweltbundesamt*), who developed the award criteria."
msgstr ""
"Merila za nagrado Modri angel za programsko opremo, s svojo osredotočenostjo "
"na preglednost v učinkovitosti virov in energije, izrabo strojne opreme in "
"avtonomije uporabnikov, zagotavlja odlično merilo za začetek razprave o "
"trajnosti programske opreme in spodbujanje nadaljnji razvoj na tem področju. "
"In tako je KDE v letu 2021 začel projekt [KDE ECO](https://eco.kde.org/), s "
"ciljem, da bi KDE in prosto programsko opremo postavil v ospredje "
"trajnostnega oblikovanja programske opreme. Trajnost ni nov cilj za prosto "
"in odprtokodno programsko opremo (FOSS). [Štiri svoboščine](http://fsfe.org/"
"freesoftware/freesoftware.en.html) so vedno postavljale prosto programsko "
"opremo v ospredje trajnostnega oblikovanja programske opreme. Kar *je* novo, "
"da so testne vrednosti zdaj priznane kot neposredno povezane s trajnostjo "
"organizacij, kot so nemška agencija za okolje (*Umweltbundesamt*), ki je "
"razvila merila za dodelitev."

#: content/blog/2022-03-16-press-release-okular-blue-angel.md:28
msgid ""
"The Blue Angel is awarded to a range of products and services, from paper "
"products to construction materials to printers. In 2020 the German "
"Environment Agency extended the award criteria to include software products, "
"which was the first in the world of environmental certifications to link "
"transparency and user autonomy with sustainability. In order to obtain the "
"ecolabel, a software product must demonstrate that it meets a list of "
"stringent requirements considered critical for the environment over the "
"product's life cycle. These include providing transparency in the energy "
"consumption when using the software -- for example, in the case of Okular, "
"while reading or annotating a PDF -- and the ability to run the application "
"on hardware at least five years old. The Blue Angel award criteria also "
"include a list of user autonomy requirements which reduce the environmental "
"impact of software."
msgstr ""
"Modri angel se dodeljuje vrsti izdelkov in storitev, od papirnatih izdelkov "
"do gradbenih materialov in tiskalnikov. V letu 2020 je nemška agencija za "
"okolje razširila merila za dodelitev, ki vključuje izdelke programske "
"opreme, ki je bila prva v svetu okoljskih certifikatov za povezovanje "
"preglednosti in avtonomije uporabnikov s trajnostjo. Za pridobitev znaka za "
"okolje mora programski izdelek dokazati, da izpolnjuje seznam strogih "
"zahtev, ki se štejejo za kritične za okolje med življenjskim ciklom izdelka. "
"Ti vključujejo zagotavljanje preglednosti pri porabi energije pri uporabi "
"programske opreme - na primer, v primeru Okularja, medtem ko berejo ali "
"označujejo PDF - in sposobnost za zagon aplikacije na strojni opremi vsaj "
"pet let. Merila za nagrado Modrega angela vključujejo tudi seznam zahtev za "
"avtonomijo uporabnikov, ki zmanjšujejo vpliv programske opreme na okolje."

#: content/blog/2022-03-16-press-release-okular-blue-angel.md:30
msgid "Blue Angel Ecolabel"
msgstr "Ekološka značka Modri angel"

#: content/blog/2022-03-16-press-release-okular-blue-angel.md:32
msgid ""
"All of these criteria reflect KDE's values and those of the larger FOSS "
"movement seamlessly. With Free and Open-Source Software, transparency is "
"guaranteed and control is handed over to the users, instead of being held "
"back by vendors or service providers. This allows users to decide what they "
"want from the software they use and, all too often overlooked, the hardware "
"as well. For instance, users may drive down the energy consumption of their "
"programs with no loss in functionality as they can install only what they "
"need, no more and no less; and avoid advertising and data-mining options, "
"which would run unnecessary processes in the background driving up the "
"consumption of resources. As for FOSS developers, they typically continue to "
"support hardware that the industry would be eager to obsolete, providing "
"users with up-to-date and secure software for devices that might otherwise "
"be discarded as e-waste and end up polluting landfills. In short, as a "
"consequence of the user freedoms and transparency guaranteed by a Free "
"Software license, users and communities are able to influence the factors "
"determining the resource consumption of their software!"
msgstr ""
"Vsa ta merila brezhibno odražajo vrednote KDE in širšega gibanja proste "
"programske opreme. S prosto in odprtokodno programsko opremo, je "
"zagotovljena preglednost in nadzor se preda uporabnikom, namesto da jih "
"zadržijo prodajalci ali ponudniki storitev. To omogoča uporabnikom, da se "
"odločijo, kaj želijo od programske opreme, ki jo uporabljajo in vse "
"prepogosto spregledane strojne opreme. Na primer, uporabniki lahko znižajo "
"porabo energije svojih programov brez izgube v funkcionalnosti, saj lahko "
"namestijo le tisto, kar potrebujejo, nič več in nič manj; izogibajo se "
"možnostim oglaševanja in podatkovnega rudarjenja, ki bi potekalo v "
"nepotrebnih procesih v ozadju, ki trošijo rabo virov. Kar se tiče za "
"razvijalce prostega programja, običajno še naprej podpirajo strojno opremo, "
"ki bi jo industrija želela da zastari, zagotavljajo uporabnikom z "
"osveževanjem in varno programsko opremo za naprave, ki bi jih sicer lahko "
"zavrgli kot e-odpadki in na koncu onesnažila odlagališča. Skratka, posledica "
"svoboščin uporabnikov in preglednosti, ki jo zagotavlja prosta licenca "
"programske opreme, uporabniki in skupnosti lahko vplivajo na dejavnike, ki "
"določajo porabo virov njihove programske opreme!"

#: content/blog/2022-03-16-press-release-okular-blue-angel.md:34
msgid ""
"Released under the GPLv2+ license, Okular is Free and Open-Source Software, "
"and so was also already fulfilling many of the user autonomy criteria "
"necessary to obtain the Blue Angel seal of approval. Further work was "
"carried out to make Okular fully compliant with all of the Blue Angel "
"criteria, and become officially recognized as providing transparency in "
"energy and resource consumption, extending the potential hardware operating "
"life of devices, and enabling user autonomy."
msgstr ""
"Okular izdan pod licenco GPLV2 + je prosta in odprtokodna programska oprema, "
"zato je tudi že izpolnila številna merila za avtonomijo uporabnikov, "
"potrebnih za pridobitev odobritve pečata Modrega angela. Nadaljnje delo je "
"bilo izvedeno, da bi bilo ustrezno v celoti skladno z vsemi merili Modrega "
"angela in postalo uradno priznano kot zagotavljanje preglednosti energetske "
"in porabe virov, ki razširjajo potencialno operativno življenjsko dobo "
"naprav strojne opreme in omogočanje avtonomije uporabnikov."

#: content/blog/2022-03-16-press-release-okular-blue-angel.md:40
msgid ""
"Okular works on Linux, Windows, Android and Plasma Mobile, and is available "
"to [download](https://okular.kde.org/download/) for all GNU/Linux "
"distributions, as a standalone package from [Flathub](https://flathub.org/"
"apps/search/okular) and the [Snap Store](https://snapcraft.io/search?"
"q=okular), through the [KDE F-Droid release repository](https://cdn.kde.org/"
"android/stable-releases/fdroid/repo/) for Android, as well as from the "
"[Microsoft Store](https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/p/"
"okular/9n41msq1wnm8#activetab=pivot:overviewtab). Being FOSS, the source "
"code is also readily available at [Okular's GitLab repository](https://"
"invent.kde.org/graphics/okular) for all to use, study, share, and improve."
msgstr ""
"Okular deluje na okolju Linux, Windows, Android in Plasma Mobile, in je na "
"voljo za [prenos](https://okular.kde.org/download/) za vse distribucije GNU/"
"Linux, kot samostojni paket od [Flathub](https://flathub.org/apps/search/"
"okular) in [Snap Store](https://snapcraft.io/search?q=okular), pri [KDE F-"
"Droid release repository](https://cdn.kde.org/android/stable-releases/fdroid/"
"repo/) za Android, kot tudi pri [Microsoft Store](https://www.microsoft.com/"
"en-us/p/okular/9n41msq1wnm8#activetab=pivot:overviewtab). Ker je prosto "
"programje, je izvorna koda na voljo tudi na [Okular's GitLab repository]"
"(https://invent.kde.org/graphics/okular) za vse za uporabo, študij, deljenje "
"in izboljšanje."

#: content/blog/2022-03-16-press-release-okular-blue-angel.md:43
msgid ""
"Today, sustainability must be considered holistically: freedom and openness "
"in software, user autonomy and control over one's digital life, and "
"transparency in our digital infrastructure's resource consumption are all a "
"part of that. Join us at [KDE Eco](https://eco.kde.org/get-involved/). Let "
"us make digital sustainability and resource-efficient Free and Open-Source "
"Software part of our future so we can live up to our responsibility for this "
"and future generations!"
msgstr ""
"Danes je treba trajnost obravnavati celostno: svoboda in odprtost v "
"programski opremi, avtonomiji uporabnikov in nadzor nad digitalnim "
"življenjem in preglednostjo v naši digitalni porabi virov infrastrukture so "
"del tega. Pridružite se nam na [KDE ECO](https://eco.kde.org/get-involved/). "
"Naj naredimo digitalno trajnost in prosto in odprtokodno programsko opremo, "
"ki je na voljo za našo prihodnost, da bomo lahko izpolnili našo odgovornost "
"za to in prihodnje generacije!"

#: content/blog/2022-09-28_okular_blue-angel-award-ceremony.md:0
msgid ""
"Blue Angel Award Ceremony At EnviroInfo Conference: Okular Officially "
"Receives Eco-Label, First Ever For Software Product"
msgstr ""
"Podelitev nagrad Blue Angel na konferenci EnviroInfo: Okular uradno prejme "
"eko-značko, sploh prvo za programski izdelek"

#: content/blog/2022-09-28_okular_blue-angel-award-ceremony.md:0
msgid "Award Ceremony"
msgstr "Podelitev nagrad"

#: content/blog/2022-09-28_okular_blue-angel-award-ceremony.md:0
msgid "EnviroInfo Conference"
msgstr "Konferenca EnviroInfo"

#: content/blog/2022-09-28_okular_blue-angel-award-ceremony.md:0
msgid ""
"On Wednesday 28 September Okular celebrated becoming the first Blue Angel "
"eco-certified software product together with the German Environment Agency "
"('Umweltbundesamt'), the Environmental Campus Birkenfeld ('Umwelt Campus "
"Birkenfeld'), and the EnviroInfo conference researchers and attendees. "
"[Updated on Friday, 7 October 2022 for Okular's celebration at Akademy 2022 "
"with KDE Eco cake.]"
msgstr ""
"V sredo 28. septembra je Okular slavil, ko je postal prvi Eko certificiran "
"programski izdelek Modri angel skupaj z nemško Agencijo za okolje "
"('Umweltbundesamt'), okoljski kampus Birkenfeld ('Umwelt Campus Birkenfeld "
"') ter raziskovalci in udeleženci konference EnviroInfo. [Posodobljeno v "
"petek, 7. oktobra 2022 za praznovanje Okularja na Akademy 2022 s KDE Eco "
"torto.]"

#: content/blog/2022-09-28_okular_blue-angel-award-ceremony.md:12
msgid ""
"*Note: This post was updated on Friday, 7 October 2022. See Section "
"[\"Update: Celebrating At Akademy 2022 (1 October)\"]({{< ref \"#akademy\" "
">}}).*"
msgstr ""
"*Opomba: Ta objava je bila posodobljena v petek, 7. oktobra 2022. Glejte "
"razdelek [\"Posodobitev: Praznovanje na Akademy 2022 (1. oktober)\"]({{< ref "
"\"#akademy\">}}).*"

#: content/blog/2022-09-28_okular_blue-angel-award-ceremony.md:14
msgid ""
"On Wednesday 28 September 2022 [Okular](https://okular.kde.org/), a Free and "
"Open Source advanced document reader that allows you to read, sign, and "
"annotate PDFs, ePubs, MarkDowns, and many other types of documents, was "
"officially celebrated for becoming the first software product to receive the "
"Blue Angel eco-label."
msgstr ""
"V sredo 28. septembra 2022 [Okular](https://okular.kde.org/), prosti in "
"odprtokodni napredni bralnik dokumentov, ki omogoča branje, podpisovanje in "
"vnos opomb v PDF -je, epub, MarkDown in številne druge vrste dokumentov, je "
"uradno proslavljen, ker je postal prvi programski izdelek, ki je prejel eko-"
"značko Blue Angel."

#: content/blog/2022-09-28_okular_blue-angel-award-ceremony.md:16
msgid ""
"As announced in March (read more [here](https://eco.kde.org/blog/2022-03-16-"
"press-release-okular-blue-angel/)), Okular has been recognized for "
"sustainable software design as reflected in the recent Blue Angel award "
"criteria for software eco-certification. Introduced in 1978, the Blue Angel "
"is the world’s earliest eco-label and the official environmental label "
"awarded by the German government. With this award, Okular is the first and "
"currently only eco-certified computer program within the 30 organizations of "
"the Global Ecolabelling Network, which represents over 50 countries."
msgstr ""
"Kot je bilo objavljeno marca (več preberite [tukaj](https://eco.kde.org/"
"blog/2022-03-16-Press-Release-Okular-Blue-Angel/)), je bil Okular prepoznan "
"kot trajnostno oblikovana programska oprema, kot je razvidno iz kriterijev "
"nedavne nagrade Blue Angel Award za ekološki certifikat programske opreme. "
"Kot je predstavljen leta 1978, je Modri angel prva ekološka značka in uradna "
"okoljska značka na svetu, ki ga podeljuje nemška vlada. S to nagrado je "
"Okular prvi in trenutno edini ekološko certificirani računalniški program v "
"30 organizacijah globalne mreže Ecolabeling, ki predstavlja več kot 50 držav."

#: content/blog/2022-09-28_okular_blue-angel-award-ceremony.md:20
msgid ""
"![Joseph, Harri, and Alexander on stage at the Blue Angel award ceremony.](/"
"blog/images/2022-09-28_kde-receiving-ecocertification.webp)"
msgstr ""
"![Joseph, Harri in Alexander na odru na slovesnosti Modri angel.](/blog/"
"images/2022-09-28_kde-receiving-ecocertification.webp)"

#: content/blog/2022-09-28_okular_blue-angel-award-ceremony.md:22
msgid ""
"*KDE's Okular receiving the Blue Angel eco-certification from the German "
"Environment Agency ('Umweltbundesamt'). From left to right: Mathias "
"Bornschein from the German Environment Agency with Joseph P. De Veaugh-"
"Geiss, Alexander Lohnau, and Harri Porten from the KDE community.*"
msgstr ""
"*KDE's Okular prejema potrdilo Modri angel iz meške agencije za okolje "
"('Umweltbundesamt'). Od leve proti desni : Mathias Bornschein iz nemške "
"agencije za okolje ter Joseph P. De Veaugh-Geiss, Alexander Lohnau in Harri "
"Porten iz skupnosti KDE.*"

#: content/blog/2022-09-28_okular_blue-angel-award-ceremony.md:27
msgid ""
"The award ceremony took place at the 36th edition of the [EnviroInfo "
"conference](https://informatik2022.gi.de/en/enviroinfo-2022) in Hamburg, "
"Germany. Three KDE community members -- Joseph P. De Veaugh-Geiss, Alexander "
"Lohnau, and Harri Porten -- were on stage to receive the award on behalf of "
"Okular and the KDE community."
msgstr ""
"Slovesnost ob podelitvi nagrad je bila na 36. konferenci [EnviroInfo]"
"(https://informatik2022.gi.de/en/enviroinfo-2022) v Hamburgu, Nemčija. Trije "
"člani skupnosti KDE -- Joseph P. De Veaugh-Geiss, Alexander Lohnau in Harri "
"Porten -- so bili na odru, da so sprejeli nagrado v imenu Okularja in "
"skupnosti KDE."

#: content/blog/2022-09-28_okular_blue-angel-award-ceremony.md:29
msgid ""
"EnviroInfo is an international and interdisciplinary conference with a focus "
"on environmental issues in information and communication technologies. "
"Researchers and attendees at the event are, quoting the website, "
"\"[c]ombining and shaping national and international activities in the field "
"of applied informatics and environmental informatics in making the world a "
"better place for living.\" The KDE community is honored to have celebrated "
"Okular's achievement at the event together with the German Environment "
"Agency ('Umweltbundesamt'), the Environmental Campus Birkenfeld ('Umwelt "
"Campus Birkenfeld'), and the larger EnviroInfo community."
msgstr ""
"EnviroInfo je mednarodna in interdisciplinarna konferenca s fokusom na "
"okoljskih vprašanjih v informacijskih in komunikacijskih tehnologijah.Kot "
"navaja spletišče, so raziskovalci in udeleženci na prireditvi delovali za "
"\"Združevanje in oblikovanje nacionalnih in mednarodnih dejavnosti na tem "
"področju uporabne informatike in okoljske informatike pri oblikovanju sveta "
"za boljši kraj za življenje.\" Skupnost KDE je počaščena, da je praznovala "
"Okularjev dosežek na prireditvi skupaj z nemško agencijo za okolje "
"('Umweltbundesamt'), okoljskim kampusom Birkenfeld ('UmweltCampus Birkenfeld "
"') in večjo skupnostjo EnviroInfo."

#: content/blog/2022-09-28_okular_blue-angel-award-ceremony.md:31
msgid ""
"Congratulations to Okular and KDE for official recognition of the "
"outstanding work you are doing!"
msgstr ""
"Čestitke Okularju in KDE za uradno priznanje odličnega dela, ki ga "
"opravljate!"

#: content/blog/2022-09-28_okular_blue-angel-award-ceremony.md:33
msgid "Update: Celebrating At Akademy 2022 (1 October)"
msgstr "Posodobitev: Praznovanje na akademiji 2022 (1. oktober)"

#: content/blog/2022-09-28_okular_blue-angel-award-ceremony.md:35
