#: content/opt-green-handbook/index.md:721
msgid "Garage door openers (OpenGarage, ratgdo)"
msgstr "Odpiralniki garažnih vrat (OpenGarage, ratgdo)"

#: content/opt-green-handbook/index.md:723
msgid ""
"There are certainly other exciting projects to make your digital life fully "
"FOSS and independent. It's a big Free & Open Source Software world out there."
msgstr ""
"Zagotovo obstajajo še drugi vznemirljivi projekti, s katerimi boste svoje "
"digitalno življenje popolnoma prilagodili svobodnemu in odprtokodnemu okolju "
"(FOSS) in ga naredili neodvisnega. Zunaj je velik svet proste in odprtokodne "
"programske opreme."

#: content/opt-green-handbook/index.md:725
msgid ""
"![Plasma Mobile is an open-source user interface for mobile devices "
